  "description": "A small, dependency-free S-expression parser and writer for .NET. Reads and writes the\nLisp-style parenthesised syntax used by KiCad files, Guile/Scheme configuration and similar formats,\ninto a plain object tree you can walk, query and serialise back out. Round trips byte-identically:\nquoting, comments, source order and whitespace all survive a parse/write cycle.",
